# ---- Legacy WordPress URLs, trailing-slash forms ----
# The old Elementor site linked and indexed every URL WITH a trailing slash.
# The slashless equivalents are generated from astro.config.mjs `redirects`,
# but reaching them costs an extra hop: /about-us/ -> (slash strip) ->
# /about-us -> /team. Listing the slashed forms here collapses that to one
# hop. Rules from public/_redirects are emitted ABOVE the generated ones in
# dist/_redirects and _redirects is first-match-wins, so these take priority.
# Keep in sync with the legacy block in astro.config.mjs.
